{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014Hzy1LbQv9CmzSbJzovDCa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0125gdex8TfbvE8EoBaAF7ST","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513/projects/collapse_aware_reward_rebalancing/docs/paper/introduction.tex"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11048,"cache_read_input_tokens":21557,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11048,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013w4D8h5fQdQZT973z4cAnC","session_id":"2b1f599e-fc53-49d6-adbf-f2a150d3d4f3","uuid":"e9ca7be9-9445-43dc-83c4-50bbb451bd01"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0125gdex8TfbvE8EoBaAF7ST","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t% Section 1: Introduction\n2\t% Note: \\section{} header is in main.tex\n3\t\n4\tIterative self-training with reward-based curation has become a prominent strategy for language model alignment. The current model generates multiple candidate responses per prompt, a reward model scores them, and the top-scoring response is selected for supervised fine-tuning to produce the next-generation model. This loop raises a fundamental stability question: if each generation retains only a narrow fraction of outputs (1 out of 4 or 1 out of 8 candidates), the compounding effect should progressively narrow the output distribution and erode the breadth that makes language models practical across diverse user needs.\n5\t\n6\tTwo research threads support this concern. The model collapse literature demonstrates that training on synthetic outputs leads to progressive distribution narrowing~\\cite{placeholder_shumailov, placeholder_alemohammad}: rare modes are underrepresented in synthetic samples, this compounds across iterations, and the model collapses onto high-density modes. Separately, RLHF studies document that single-round reward optimization reduces lexical and semantic variety~\\cite{placeholder_kirk}. Together, these establish a strong prior: iterative reward-curated self-training should cause diversity collapse with increasing severity at each generation.\n7\t\n8\tYet neither literature directly addresses the deployed setting. Model collapse results study unfiltered self-consumption where the model trains on its full output distribution; reward-curated pipelines apply an external selection filter, retain a fixed prompt scaffold across generations, and decode stochastically, all of which violate the theoretical preconditions for progressive narrowing. The RLHF literature examines single rounds rather than multi-generation iteration. No prior work has systematically measured whether diversity degrades across multiple generations of reward-curated fine-tuning under controlled factorial conditions.\n9\t\n10\tWe fill this gap with a controlled experiment spanning 8 configurations and 3 generations. The central result overturns expectations: semantic diversity (Vendi Score~\\cite{placeholder_vendi}) remains stable across all curated conditions ($-0.27\\%$ to $+0.91\\%$), including extreme selection pressure ($K{=}16$, 6.25\\% retention, $\\Delta = -0.19\\%$). However, this stability masks \\emph{metric-dependent collapse}: format diversity degrades substantially regardless of curation, with near-duplicate start rate rising from 37.9\\% to 75.6\\% and opening entropy dropping 0.75 bits at $K{=}4$. Standard embedding-based metrics are blind to this convergence. A second finding concerns the interaction between adaptation method and curation: under LoRA, curation suppresses Vendi Score by $-3.40$ pp relative to random, but under Full-FT with higher learning rate, curation promotes diversity by $+0.63$ pp. This pattern is consistent with a capacity artifact: LoRA's rank-16 bottleneck limits how much distributional structure the model can absorb, and the apparent suppression disappears when this constraint is removed.\n11\t\n12\tOur experimental design isolates four factors: adaptation method (LoRA versus Full-FT), selection pressure ($K \\in \\{4, 8, 16\\}$, corresponding to 25\\%, 12.5\\%, and 6.25\\% retention rates), learning rate ($5 \\times 10^{-6}$ versus $2 \\times 10^{-5}$), and curation strategy (reward top-1 versus random selection). All experiments use Qwen3-0.6B (596M parameters) as the base model, ArmoRM-Llama3-8B-v0.1~\\cite{placeholder_armorm} as the reward model, and a fixed set of 2{,}200 prompts from UltraFeedback. This factorial structure enables direct attribution of observed diversity changes to specific experimental factors rather than confounding variation in data composition or model scale.\n13\t\n14\tOur contributions are as follows:\n15\t\\begin{enumerate}\n16\t    \\item We provide systematic evidence that reward curation does not cause semantic diversity collapse in iterative self-training. Across 8 configurations and 3 generations, all curated conditions maintain Vendi Score within 1\\% of the initial value, even under extreme selection pressure ($K{=}16$, 6.25\\% retention). This result contradicts expectations from the model collapse literature.\n17\t    \\item We identify metric-dependent collapse: format diversity (response openings, structural templates) degrades substantially while embedding-based semantic diversity remains stable. This degradation occurs at comparable rates under curated and random selection, which indicates it is inherent to iterative self-training rather than caused by reward filtering. The effect intensifies with candidate pool size ($K{=}16$, $-$0.19\\% Vendi but 1.13 bits opening entropy loss at $K{=}8$). We propose two complementary indicators, \\texttt{opening\\_entropy} and \\texttt{near\\_dup\\_start\\_rate}, that capture this previously invisible dimension of homogenization, and recommend their inclusion in diversity audits alongside standard embedding-based measures.\n18\t    \\item We observe a direction reversal in the effect of curation across adaptation methods: curation suppresses diversity under LoRA ($-3.40$ pp) but promotes it under Full-FT ($+0.63$ pp), a pattern consistent with LoRA's rank-16 bottleneck constraining how much distributional structure the model can absorb from curated data.\n19\t\\end{enumerate}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013w4D8h5fQdQZT973z4cAnC","session_id":"2b1f599e-fc53-49d6-adbf-f2a150d3d4f3","uuid":"75410f78-1426-4511-a896-ba8967c0ec7d","timestamp":"2026-05-17T14:43:20.760Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017C26TZv4ryGocYR4ZBHhnp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 (semantic resilience) 跨模型确认——1.5B Vendi 仍未 collapse，但\n2\t  curated vs random gap 从 0.6B 的 -3.4pp 缩窄至接近零，表明 LoRA capacity artifact 效应随模型规模减弱。\n3\t  Claim 2 (format collapse inherent) 需降级——1.5B 上 curated 与 random 的 format entropy\n4\t  drop 出现 ~0.35 bits 差距（0.6B 为零），说明 curation 在更大模型上成为 secondary amplifier， 结论从 \"inherent,\n5\t  curation-neutral\" 调整为 \"primarily iteration-driven, with curation as scale-dependent\n6\t  secondary amplifier\"。Claim 3 在 1.5B 上只有 LoRA 单数据点，无法验证 direction reversal，标注为 future\n7\t  work。整体叙事从 \"universal\" 调为 \"robust with scale-dependent nuances\"，仍可投 EMNLP 但需在 Discussion\n8\t  诚实交代 scale gap。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: LoRA K=4 curated baseline\n13\t  plan_id: plan_001\n14\t  description: Qwen3-0.6B LoRA K=4 curated, 3 gens. Core semantic resilience test.\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    vendi_score_gen0: 107.54\n17\t    vendi_score_gen1: 106.73\n18\t    vendi_score_gen2: 107.25\n19\t    vendi_decline_pct: -0.28\n20\t    mean_nn_distance_gen0: 0.7088\n21\t    mean_nn_distance_gen2: 0.7054\n22\t    self_bleu_gen2: 0.0062\n23\t    perplexity_gen2: 9.72\n24\t    mean_quality_gen2: 0.1109\n25\t    p1_pass: false\n26\t    opening_entropy_drop_bits: -0.75\n27\t    near_dup_start_rate_increase_pp: 37\n28\t  result_rationale: 'LoRA 的参数容量限制（rank=16 仅更新 <1% 参数）在所有方向上约束漂移， 包括多样性坍缩方向。K=4 curated\n29\t    只保留 25% 样本，但 LoRA 的容量天花板 使模型无法充分学习 curated 子集的分布偏移，因此 Vendi 变化极微（-0.28%）。 格式坍缩（entropy\n30\t    -0.75 bits）仍然发生，因为 opening pattern 是表层特征， 即使有限的参数更新也能迅速收敛到高频模板。\n31\t\n32\t    '\n33\t  tables:\n34\t  - 'Table 1 Row: C1 (LoRA K=4 curated) 三代 Vendi/self-BLEU/NN-dist/perplexity 完整轨迹'\n35\t  - 'Table 4 Row: C1 format metrics (opening_entropy, near_dup_start_rate)'\n36\t  figures_description:\n37\t  - 'Figure 2: 此配置为 8-config Vendi 轨迹图的一条线（蓝色实线），3 代基本水平'\n38\t  - 'Figure 4 左侧: C1 opening entropy 下降柱状图，与 C5 (random) 等高'\n39\t  analysis: 'P1 未通过（未检测到 collapse），确认 semantic resilience。此配置是 LoRA capacity artifact\n40\t    的核心证据之一：curated 的 Vendi 微降而 random 的 Vendi 上升，产生 -3.4pp gap。但这个 gap 在 1.5B 上是否复现是\n41\t    median tier 的关键变量。\n42\t\n43\t    '\n44\t- name: LoRA K=8 curated\n45\t  plan_id: plan_002\n46\t  description: Qwen3-0.6B LoRA K=8 curated, 3 gens. Higher selection pressure.\n47\t  expected_results:\n48\t    vendi_score_gen0: 107.3\n49\t    vendi_score_gen1: 106.5\n50\t    vendi_score_gen2: 106.9\n51\t    vendi_decline_pct: -0.37\n52\t    mean_nn_distance_gen0: 0.7075\n53\t    mean_nn_distance_gen2: 0.7048\n54\t    self_bleu_gen2: 0.007\n55\t    perplexity_gen2: 9.45\n56\t    p1_pass: false\n57\t    opening_entropy_drop_bits: -1.13\n58\t    near_dup_start_rate_increase_pp: 42\n59\t  result_rationale: 'K=8 保留 12.5% 样本，选择压力是 K=4 的两倍，但 LoRA 容量天花板同样限制了 语义漂移——Vendi 变化量级与\n60\t    K=4 相当（-0.37% vs -0.28%）。关键差异在格式层面： 更高 K 意味着保留的样本 format 更同质（reward-top 倾向相似开头模式），\n61\t    K=8 的 opening entropy 比 K=4 多降 0.38 bits（-1.13 vs -0.75），证实 K 是 format collapse\n62\t    的放大器。这支撑 Claim 2 的 \"K amplifies severity\" 子论点。\n63\t\n64\t    '\n65\t  tables:\n66\t  - 'Table 1 Row: C2 (LoRA K=8 curated) 三代核心指标'\n67\t  - 'Table 4 Row: C2 format metrics，与 C1 (K=4) 对比突出 K 的放大效应'\n68\t  figures_description:\n69\t  - 'Figure 2: C2 线条与 C1 几乎重叠（Vendi 层面 K 效应不可见）'\n70\t  - 'Figure 4 右侧: C2 entropy 柱更高，标注 K=8 vs K=4 差异'\n71\t  analysis: '语义层面 K=4→K=8 的选择压力倍增未导致额外 Vendi 下降，强化了 semantic resilience 的鲁棒性。格式层面\n72\t    K 的放大效应清晰（-1.13 vs -0.75 bits）， 但这仍是 iterative training 固有的，与 curation 无关——需要\n73\t    K=8 random 对照 才能完全隔离变量，当前分析依赖 K=4 的 curated=random 等价性外推。\n74\t\n75\t    '\n76\t- name: LoRA K=4 random baseline\n77\t  plan_id: plan_003\n78\t  description: Qwen3-0.6B LoRA K=4 random selection, 3 gens. Control condition.\n79\t  expected_results:\n80\t    vendi_score_gen0: 105.42\n81\t    vendi_score_gen1: 108.21\n82\t    vendi_score_gen2: 108.72\n83\t    vendi_decline_pct: 3.13\n84\t    mean_nn_distance_gen0: 0.7005\n85\t    mean_nn_distance_gen2: 0.7136\n86\t    self_bleu_gen2: 0.0067\n87\t    perplexity_gen2: 11.18\n88\t    mean_quality_gen2: 0.1096\n89\t    complexity_mean_gen2: 2.8\n90\t    opening_entropy_drop_bits: -0.75\n91\t    near_dup_start_rate_increase_pp: 37\n92\t  result_rationale: 'Random selection 保留 K=4 的训练数据量但不施加 reward 偏向。Vendi 反而上升 3.13%，因为随机子集每代引入的\n93\t    distribution shift 比 curated 更分散——LoRA 在无方向性信号下的微小更新导致输出略微发散。与 curated 的 -0.28%\n94\t    形成 -3.4pp gap，但这完全由 LoRA 容量限制造成（curated 信号被压缩，random 噪声 被放大为微小发散）。format entropy\n95\t    与 curated 完全相同（-0.75 bits）， 证明 format collapse 与 curation 无关，纯粹是 iterative self-training\n96\t    固有的。\n97\t\n98\t    '\n99\t  tables:\n100\t  - 'Table 1 Row: C5 (LoRA K=4 random) 三代完整指标'\n101\t  - 'Table 4 Row: C5 format metrics，与 C1 逐项对齐证明 curation-neutral'\n102\t  figures_description:\n103\t  - 'Figure 2: C5 线条上升明显，与 C1 形成视觉对比（但 Y 轴范围小，差异不大）'\n104\t  - 'Figure 3: Direction reversal 柱状图左侧——LoRA regime gap = -3.4pp'\n105\t  - 'Figure 4: C5 与 C1 柱状图等高，关键视觉证据'\n106\t  analysis: 'C5 是整个论文最关键的对照实验之一。(1) 与 C1 的 Vendi gap (-3.4pp) 建立了 LoRA capacity artifact\n107\t    的基线证据。(2) 与 C1 format metrics 完全一致的结果 是 Claim 2 (format collapse inherent) 的核心支柱。在\n108\t    median tier 下，这些 0.6B 结论保持不变，但 1.5B 上的复现情况将决定结论是否需要加 qualifier。\n109\t\n110\t    '\n111\t- name: Full-FT K=4 curated LR=2e-5\n112\t  plan_id: plan_004\n113\t  description: Full fine-tuning high LR. Tests capacity effect on curation.\n114\t  expected_results:\n115\t    vendi_score_gen0: 107.1\n116\t    vendi_score_gen1: 107.61\n117\t    vendi_score_gen2: 108.07\n118\t    vendi_decline_pct: 0.91\n119\t    mean_nn_distance_gen0: 0.7073\n120\t    mean_nn_distance_gen2: 0.7108\n121\t    self_bleu_gen2: 0.0044\n122\t    perplexity_gen2: 9.21\n123\t    mean_quality_gen2: 0.1131\n124\t    complexity_mean_gen2: 2.813\n125\t  result_rationale: 'Full-FT 解除了 LoRA 的参数容量限制，LR=2e-5 是足够高的学习率让模型 充分学习 curated 子集的分布。在此条件下\n126\t    curation 的效应反转——curated 子集的 reward-top 样本虽然 format 更统一，但语义更集中于 \"好\" 的区域， Full-FT\n127\t    有足够参数容量将这种语义集中转化为更高的 embedding 空间覆盖 （高质量样本通常更具多样性）。Vendi 上升 0.91%，与 random 的 0.046%\n128\t    形成 +0.86pp 正向 gap，完成 direction reversal。\n129\t\n130\t    '\n131\t  tables:\n132\t  - 'Table 1 Row: C3 (Full-FT K=4 curated high-LR) 三代指标'\n133\t  - 'Table 2: Vendi 轨迹汇总行'\n134\t  figures_description:\n135\t  - 'Figure 2: C3 线条缓慢上升'\n136\t  - 'Figure 3: Direction reversal 柱状图右侧——Full-FT high-LR gap = +0.86pp'\n137\t  analysis: '与 plan_001 (LoRA curated) 对比是 Claim 3 的核心证据。同样的 curation 策略（K=4 curated）在不同容量下效果完全相反：LoRA\n138\t    下 gap=-3.4pp， Full-FT high-LR 下 gap=+0.86pp。在 median tier 下，1.5B 无 Full-FT 对照，无法在\n139\t    1.5B 上独立验证此结论，需标注为 0.6B-only finding。\n140\t\n141\t    '\n142\t- name: Full-FT K=4 curated LR=5e-6\n143\t  plan_id: plan_005\n144\t  description: Full fine-tuning low LR. Intermediate capacity regime.\n145\t  expected_results:\n146\t    vendi_score_gen0: 108.08\n147\t    vendi_score_gen1: 107.75\n148\t    vendi_score_gen2: 108.38\n149\t    vendi_decline_pct: 0.28\n150\t    mean_nn_distance_gen0: 0.7065\n151\t    mean_nn_distance_gen2: 0.7082\n152\t    self_bleu_gen2: 0.0055\n153\t    perplexity_gen2: 8.95\n154\t    p1_pass: false\n155\t  result_rationale: 'Full-FT 移除了参数限制但 LR=5e-6（仅为高 LR 的 1/4）限制了每步更新幅度， 形成 \"中间容量\" 状态。模型可以学习\n156\t    curated 信号但更新缓慢——curation 的 正向效应（语义多样性提升）刚开始显现但尚不充分。Vendi 微升 0.28%，恰好 位于 LoRA\n157\t    (-0.28%) 和 Full-FT high-LR (0.91%) 之间，确认三点单调梯度。 Gap 接近零（约 +0.2pp），处于从抑制到促进的转折点。\n158\t\n159\t    '\n160\t  tables:\n161\t  - 'Table 1 Row: C4-lowLR 三代核心指标'\n162\t  - 'Table 2: Direction reversal 中间数据点'\n163\t  figures_description:\n164\t  - 'Figure 3: Direction reversal 柱状图中间数据点——gap ≈ +0.2pp（几乎为零）'\n165\t  analysis: '作为 direction reversal 的中间锚点，这个实验将两点线性插值提升为三点 单调趋势，显著增强 Claim 3 的可信度。审稿人可能质疑\n166\t    \"两点就能画趋势\"， 三点梯度回应了这个担忧。在 median tier 下，1.5B 只有 LoRA 无法提供 第二组梯度数据，但 0.6B 的三点趋势本身已足够支撑\n167\t    Claim 3。\n168\t\n169\t    '\n170\t- name: Full-FT K=4 random LR=2e-5\n171\t  plan_id: plan_006\n172\t  description: Full-FT random baseline for direction reversal comparison.\n173\t  expected_results:\n174\t    vendi_score_gen0: 108.08\n175\t    vendi_score_gen1: 107.85\n176\t    vendi_score_gen2: 108.13\n177\t    vendi_decline_pct: 0.046\n178\t    mean_nn_distance_gen0: 0.7068\n179\t    mean_nn_distance_gen2: 0.709\n180\t  result_rationale: 'Full-FT random 是 direction reversal 的对照基线。Random selection 下\n181\t    Full-FT 的 Vendi 几乎不变（+0.046%），因为随机子集没有系统性偏向， Full-FT 的高容量也没有特定方向可学。这个近零基线使得 curated\n182\t    的 +0.91% 形成清晰的正向 gap (+0.86pp)，完成 direction reversal 论证。\n183\t\n184\t    '\n185\t  tables:\n186\t  - 'Table 1 Row: C6 (Full-FT K=4 random high-LR)'\n187\t  figures_description:\n188\t  - 'Figure 3: Random baseline 虚线，curated 柱状图相对其高出 0.86pp'\n189\t  analysis: '此实验的 near-zero 结果是 direction reversal 的必要条件——如果 random 在 Full-FT 下也大幅上升，curated\n190\t    的上升就不能归因于 curation 效应。 +0.046% 的近零值确认了 Full-FT high-LR 下 curated 的 +0.91% 是 curation\n191\t    的真实正向效应。\n192\t\n193\t    '\n194\t- name: Full-FT K=16 extreme pressure\n195\t  plan_id: plan_007\n196\t  description: K=16 (6.25% retention) extreme selection pressure test.\n197\t  expected_results:\n198\t    vendi_score_gen0: 107.32\n199\t    vendi_score_gen1: 106.73\n200\t    vendi_score_gen2: 107.11\n201\t    vendi_decline_pct: -0.19\n202\t    mean_nn_distance_gen0: 0.7057\n203\t    mean_nn_distance_gen2: 0.7092\n204\t    self_bleu_gen2: 0.0058\n205\t    perplexity_gen0: 8.5\n206\t    perplexity_gen2: 7.71\n207\t    mean_quality_gen2: 0.1149\n208\t    training_loss_trajectory: 0.206 → 0.129 → 0.097\n209\t  result_rationale: 'K=16 仅保留 6.25% 样本（~138 条/2200），是极端选择压力。训练 loss 从 0.206 降至 0.097（53%\n210\t    降幅），证明模型在真实学习而非欠拟合。即便如此 Vendi 仅微降 0.19%，因为 Full-FT 的高容量将 curated 极端子集的 语义信号转化为覆盖而非坍缩。这是\n211\t    semantic resilience 的 stress test—— 连 80%+ 数据被丢弃的极端条件下多样性仍然稳定。\n212\t\n213\t    '\n214\t  tables:\n215\t  - 'Table 1 Row: C8 (Full-FT K=16 extreme) 含 training loss 轨迹'\n216\t  - 'Table 2: Highlight K=16 Vendi decline 仅 -0.19%'\n217\t  figures_description:\n218\t  - 'Figure 2: C8 线条与其他配置重叠，标注 K=16 强调极端压力下的稳定性'\n219\t  analysis: 'K=16 是 Claim 1 的杀手级证据——\"即使保留率仅 6.25%、loss 下降 53%， Vendi 仍稳定\" 直接回应审稿人\n220\t    \"你的 K 不够大\" 的质疑。training loss 的大幅下降排除了 \"模型没学到东西\" 的反驳。在 median tier 下此结论 不受 1.5B\n221\t    结果影响。\n222\t\n223\t    '\n224\t- name: C1 regen for same-K format comparison\n225\t  plan_id: plan_008\n226\t  description: Regenerate C1 (curated K=4) data for controlled C1 vs C5 format comparison.\n227\t  expected_results:\n228\t    vendi_score_gen0: 107.21\n229\t    vendi_score_gen1: 106.87\n230\t    vendi_score_gen2: 108.42\n231\t    vendi_decline_pct: 1.13\n232\t    mean_nn_distance_gen0: 0.7058\n233\t    mean_nn_distance_gen2: 0.7126\n234\t    self_bleu_gen2: 0.0047\n235\t    perplexity_gen2: 9.399\n236\t    opening_entropy_drop_bits: -0.75\n237\t    near_dup_start_rate_increase_pp: 37\n238\t  result_rationale: 'C1 regen 使用与 C5 (random) 完全相同的 pipeline 和超参，唯一差异是 curation 策略。重新生成确保对照的公平性（排除随机种子、生成时间等混淆因素）。\n239\t    format metrics 与 C5 完全一致（entropy 均 -0.75 bits, near-dup 均 +37pp） 是 Claim 2 的决定性证据：在\n240\t    0.6B LoRA K=4 条件下，curation 对 format collapse 的贡献为精确零。format collapse 完全由 iterative\n241\t    self-training 本身驱动。\n242\t\n243\t    '\n244\t  tables:\n245\t  - 'Table 4: C1-regen vs C5 逐项对比，所有 format metrics 差异 < 0.05'\n246\t  figures_description:\n247\t  - 'Figure 4: 关键视觉——C1 和 C5 柱状图等高，直观证明 curation-neutral'\n248\t  analysis: '这个实验是 Claim 2 的基石。在 median tier 下，0.6B 的 curation-neutral 结论保持不变，但 1.5B\n249\t    的 format 结果将显示 0.35 bits 的 curated/random 差距，需要将 Claim 2 从 \"完全 curation-neutral\"\n250\t    降级为 \"primarily iteration-driven, with scale-dependent curation amplification\"。\n251\t\n252\t    '\n253\t- name: Qwen2.5-1.5B LoRA K=4 curated\n254\t  plan_id: plan_009\n255\t  description: Cross-model scale verification. Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct LoRA K=4 curated,\n256\t    5 gens.\n257\t  expected_results:\n258\t    vendi_score_gen0: 106.8\n259\t    vendi_score_gen1: 106.45\n260\t    vendi_score_gen2: 106.9\n261\t    vendi_score_gen3: 107.15\n262\t    vendi_score_gen4: 107.65\n263\t    vendi_decline_pct: 0.8\n264\t    mean_nn_distance_gen0: 0.7035\n265\t    mean_nn_distance_gen2: 0.7042\n266\t    mean_nn_distance_gen4: 0.705\n267\t    self_bleu_gen0: 0.0055\n268\t    self_bleu_gen4: 0.0063\n269\t    perplexity_gen0: 7.8\n270\t    perplexity_gen4: 6.55\n271\t    mean_quality_gen0: 0.1215\n272\t    mean_quality_gen4: 0.1248\n273\t    training_loss_trajectory: 0.32 → 0.22 → 0.17 → 0.13 → 0.10\n274\t    opening_entropy_gen0: 3.85\n275\t    opening_entropy_gen4: 2.95\n276\t    opening_entropy_drop_bits: -0.9\n277\t    near_dup_start_rate_gen0_pct: 8\n278\t    near_dup_start_rate_gen4_pct: 38\n279\t    near_dup_increase_pp: 30\n280\t    p1_pass: false\n281\t  result_rationale: '1.5B 模型的 LoRA（同 rank=16）相对于总参数量的比例更低（<0.5% vs 0.6B 的 ~1%），capacity\n282\t    constraint 反而更紧。但 1.5B 的 base representation 更丰富，初始 embedding 空间已覆盖更广，LoRA 微调对分布的扰动更小。\n283\t    这两个效应部分抵消，导致 Vendi 轨迹与 0.6B 不同：不再微降而是微升 （+0.80%），因为 1.5B 更强的 base representation\n284\t    使得即使 LoRA 受限 的更新也能略微扩展覆盖。curated 的 Vendi 仍低于 random 的（gap ≈ -0.4pp）， 方向与 0.6B\n285\t    一致但量级大幅缩小（-0.4 vs -3.4pp），说明 LoRA capacity artifact 在更大模型上效应减弱——更大的 base capacity\n286\t    部分补偿了 LoRA 的限制。格式层面，opening entropy 降 0.90 bits（5 代累积），比 0.6B 3 代的 -0.75 bits\n287\t    更大，但 per-generation 速率相近（~0.18 bits/gen vs 0.25 bits/gen）。关键差异：curated 的 format\n288\t    下降比 random 多 0.35 bits，打破了 0.6B 上的 curated=random 等价性——1.5B 的更强学习能力使模型 能够部分捕捉\n289\t    curated 子集的 format 偏向，curation 成为次要放大器。\n290\t\n291\t    '\n292\t  tables:\n293\t  - 'Table 5: 1.5B cross-model 5-gen Vendi/NN-dist/self-BLEU/perplexity 完整轨迹'\n294\t  - 'Table 6: 1.5B format metrics (curated vs random) 对比，突出 0.35-bit gap'\n295\t  figures_description:\n296\t  - 'Figure 5: 1.5B Vendi 5-gen 轨迹（curated vs random），Y 轴范围 105-109'\n297\t  - 'Figure 6: Format entropy 对比——0.6B (gap=0) vs 1.5B (gap=0.35 bits) 双面板'\n298\t  analysis: 'Semantic resilience 在 1.5B 上确认（Vendi 稳定甚至微升），支撑 Claim 1 的 跨模型泛化。但 LoRA\n299\t    capacity artifact 的效应大幅减弱（gap 从 -3.4pp 缩至 -0.4pp），表明 artifact 的量级是 scale-dependent\n300\t    的——1.5B 的更大 base capacity 使 LoRA 限制的相对影响更小。format 层面出现了 curated/random 不对称（0.35\n301\t    bits），要求 Claim 2 加 qualifier。这是 median tier 的 核心发现：结论方向正确但需要 nuance。Discussion\n302\t    应明确指出 \"0.6B 上 format collapse 完全 curation-neutral 可能是小模型 LoRA 容量限制的 另一个 artifact——更大模型的更强学习能力揭示了\n303\t    curation 的次要放大效应\"。\n304\t\n305\t    '\n306\t- name: Qwen2.5-1.5B LoRA K=4 random\n307\t  plan_id: plan_010\n308\t  description: Random baseline for 1.5B cross-model comparison, 5 gens.\n309\t  expected_results:\n310\t    vendi_score_gen0: 106.5\n311\t    vendi_score_gen1: 107.0\n312\t    vendi_score_gen2: 107.3\n313\t    vendi_score_gen3: 107.55\n314\t    vendi_score_gen4: 107.8\n315\t    vendi_decline_pct: 1.22\n316\t    mean_nn_distance_gen0: 0.702\n317\t    mean_nn_distance_gen2: 0.706\n318\t    mean_nn_distance_gen4: 0.708\n319\t    self_bleu_gen0: 0.0048\n320\t    self_bleu_gen4: 0.0057\n321\t    perplexity_gen0: 7.9\n322\t    perplexity_gen4: 6.7\n323\t    mean_quality_gen0: 0.1198\n324\t    mean_quality_gen4: 0.1225\n325\t    training_loss_trajectory: 0.30 → 0.21 → 0.16 → 0.12 → 0.10\n326\t    opening_entropy_gen0: 3.8\n327\t    opening_entropy_gen4: 3.25\n328\t    opening_entropy_drop_bits: -0.55\n329\t    near_dup_start_rate_gen0_pct: 7\n330\t    near_dup_start_rate_gen4_pct: 25\n331\t    near_dup_increase_pp: 18\n332\t    p1_pass: false\n333\t  result_rationale: '1.5B random 作为对照，Vendi 上升 1.22%（与 0.6B random 的 +3.13% 方向 一致但幅度更小）。幅度缩小的原因：1.5B\n334\t    base model 的初始 embedding 覆盖 已更广，random perturbation 引起的发散空间更小。与 curated (+0.80%)\n335\t    的 gap 为 -0.42pp，远小于 0.6B 的 -3.4pp，接近零——说明在 1.5B 尺度上 LoRA capacity artifact 对 curated\n336\t    vs random 差异的放大效应大幅衰减。 格式层面，random 的 entropy 仅下降 0.55 bits（vs curated 0.90 bits），\n337\t    产生 0.35 bits gap。这意味着在 1.5B 上，curated 子集的 format 同质性 确实会被模型学到——random 子集 format\n338\t    更分散，模型学到的 opening pattern 更多样。这个差异在 0.6B 上被 LoRA 的极度容量限制掩盖了（两者都被压到 同样的下限），1.5B\n339\t    的相对更大容量让差异浮现。\n340\t\n341\t    '\n342\t  tables:\n343\t  - 'Table 5: 1.5B random 5-gen 完整轨迹，与 curated 并列'\n344\t  - 'Table 6: Format gap 量化——curated -0.90 vs random -0.55 = 0.35 bits'\n345\t  figures_description:\n346\t  - 'Figure 5: Random 线条（虚线）与 curated 线条（实线）几乎重叠（Vendi 层面差异极小）'\n347\t  - 'Figure 6 右面板: 1.5B curated 柱高于 random，标注 Δ=0.35 bits'\n348\t  analysis: Random baseline 确认两个关键结论：(1) Vendi gap 接近零（-0.42pp）支持 semantic resilience\n349\t    跨模型成立但 capacity artifact 量级缩小；(2) format gap 非零（0.35 bits）要求修改 Claim 2 措辞。论文 Discussion\n350\t    应讨论： 0.6B 上 curated=random 的 format 等价性可能本身就是 LoRA 在小模型上的 artifact——当模型有更多容量时，curation\n351\t    的 format 偏向会被部分学到。 这不推翻 \"format collapse 主要由 iteration 驱动\" 的核心结论，但需要 加上 \"curation\n352\t    is a secondary, scale-dependent amplifier\" 的 qualifier。 整体叙事调整为 \"robust pattern\n353\t    with scale-dependent nuances\"， 诚实但不削弱论文的核心贡献，仍然适合 EMNLP Discussion track。\n354\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0171YWRYW2pbFasaRYcnpYd1","session_id":"2b1f599e-fc53-49d6-adbf-f2a150d3d4f3","uuid":"7ac47101-97be-4e20-97ef-d7b41f0eee73","timestamp":"2026-05-17T14:43:19.978Z"}
